<p class="muted small">
  Adds <code>/stats battlefield</code> — Battlefield-series player stat lookups (K/D, win rate,
  time played, KPM/SPM, best class, …) via the public
  <a href="https://gametools.network" target="_blank" rel="noopener">gametools.network</a> API.
  Enable this module here to make the command available in this server.
</p>

<section class="card">
  <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">Command</h3>
  <ul class="muted small" style="margin:0; padding-left:18px; line-height:1.7">
    <li><code>/stats battlefield title:… username:… platform:…</code></li>
    <li>Titles: BF1, BF3, BF4, BFV, Hardline — plus best-effort BF2042 and BF6.</li>
    <li>Results are cached for <code>STATS_CACHE_TTL_MINUTES</code> (default 5) to spare the upstream API.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="small" style="margin:8px 0 0">
    Recent lookups across the whole bot: <a href="/stats">/stats</a>.
  </p>
</section>
